---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Cookie Policy | Toolbox Image" description="How Toolbox Image uses cookies and similar technologies on this site." path="/cookie" lang="en" altLang={null}>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: June 5, 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">1</span>What cookies are</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help remember preferences and understand site usage.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">2</span>Why we use cookies</h2>
      <p>We use cookies for essential site functions, remembering consent choices, analytics, traffic measurement, and technical diagnostics.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">3</span>Types of cookies</h2>
      <p>Essential cookies keep the site working. Analytics cookies help us understand which pages are used and whether performance or usability issues appear.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">4</span>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Some cookies may be set by third-party services for analytics, hosting, security, or consent management. The exact vendors may change as the site evolves.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">5</span>How to control cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control cookies through the site consent controls, browser settings, or privacy extensions. Blocking essential cookies may affect parts of the site.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">6</span>Contact and updates</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy when site functionality or vendors change. Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:yangkunming2026@gmail.com">yangkunming2026@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
